Romans Chapter 3 The Advantage Jews Had 1 So, what advantage does a Jew have? What’s the benefit of circumcision? 2 A lot, in a lot of ways. The first advantage is that God entrusted the Jews with his messages. 3 So what if some Jews were unfaithful? Their unfaithfulness doesn’t do away with God’s faithfulness, does it? 4 Goodness, no! Let God be true and everyone else a liar, like the scripture says, “ . . . that you can be regarded as right in what you say
and correct in the judgments you make” [Ps 51:4].
